      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "故郷へ帰る途中のグランナダ砦跡って場所に\n盗賊の一団がたむろしていて通れないんだ……\n病気のおふくろに薬を届けなきゃいけないのに……\n誰でもいい、奴らを追い払ってくれ！",
        "official_en": "On the road to my hometown, a group of thieves\nhave made camp at the Granada Fort Ruins. With\nthem around, I'll never be able to get this medicine\nto my mom... Please, somebody, do something!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
