      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "奴らを退治してくれたのか！？　ありがとう！\n本当に盗賊って奴は次から次に湧いてくるよなあ……\nあんたには世話になったな。礼を受け取ってくれ。\n俺とおふくろ二人分の感謝の気持ちだぜ！",
        "official_en": "You really beat the thieves?! Thank you! This bandit\nproblem really is getting out of hand, isn't it? Either\nway, you've been a big help. Here, take this...\nConsider it a thank-you from me and my mother.",
